OL,3,ANigel Farage tells BBC he 'wasn't
OL,4,Alistening' during foreign donor talks
OL,5,Afilmed undercover
OL,6,
OL,7,FNigel Farage has said he "frankly
OL,8,Fwasn't listening" during a conversation
OL,9,Fwith his former chief of staff and an
OL,10,Fundercover reporter discussing what
OL,11,Fappears to have been a scheme to funnel
OL,12,Fforeign money to Reform UK.
OL,14,FHis former chief of staff Dan Jukes and
OL,15,Fex-head of policy James Orr have both
OL,16,Fbeen removed from their jobs after an
OL,17,Finvestigation recorded them talking
OL,18,Fabout how to get money to the party
OL,19,Ffrom an American donor and asking a
OL,20,Ffake company to pay for polling.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
